id: pmc-tracker-milestones
title: Generate release notes from immutable tracker milestones
description: Add a backend-neutral immutable release source and a tracker milestone creation command for plain-directory and SDK database snapshots.
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: added,changelog,no-git
created_at: "2026-10-21T18:17:49.989Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-24T21:43:57.733Z"
